1. ctrl + alt + T -> open terminal
2. pwd -> for find where you are
3. cd the name of the file -> to open the file 
4. cd .. -> for back to the previous file
5. mkdir -> make direction for open a new file
6. ls -> for see all files
7. rm -r the name of the file -> for delete the file or rm -rf the name of the file -> for deleting the file without confirmation
